@startuml 26_communication_ingestion
title Monitoring report communication under ACTIVE host credential
object "agent:Service" as Agent
object "api:FastAPI" as API
object "credentials:Validator" as Validator
object "store:PrivatePostgres" as Store
Agent --> API : 1: HTTPS POST report + bearer token
API --> Validator : 1.1: hash token + require ACTIVE host
Validator --> Store : 1.1.1: find active matching host ID
Store --> Validator : 1.1.2: authorized host or none
API --> Store : 1.2: atomic sample, processes and heartbeat
Store --> API : 1.3: receipt time and host ID
API --> Agent : 1.4: HTTP 202, else 401
note bottom of Store : Invalid/revoked credentials cannot write samples or heartbeat.
@enduml
